{
  "description": "The file object of CLI-UAL-65: bucket(size) = the smallest power of two >= max(2^16, size + 8) in integers, 2^30 on 64-bit targets and 2^27 on wasm32 (above: FileTooLarge); frame = size (8 B big-endian) ‖ file ‖ zero pad; object = AES-256-GCM(file key, 0^96, frame), bucket + 16 B; the reader's checks before decryption (length, ctSha256) and after (len, pad, sha256). A file is rnd(fileSeed, size); objects are pinned by SHA-256, head and tail. Generated by clients/clientkeys/scripts/arweave-vectors.mjs.",
